# The planner's seed: one person's term timetable, diary and to-do list. The
# engine lives in standalone/planner/ and is committed; the seed is not, and
# a timetable says where somebody is at every hour of every weekday. Keep
# yours outside the repo and pass --data to tools/build_planner.py.
# tests/test_planner.py also fails if a second seed appears beside the
# sample, because a rule nobody can see is a rule that gets broken.
planner-data.js
standalone/planner/data.js
september-planner.html

# Coverage JSON, written by tooling when inspecting gaps.
cov.json
